#. <CLT 4>雑誌が置いてある…
#. 前とは違うゴシップ誌だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a bunch of magazines. The gossip magazine this\n"
"time is different from before.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>誰かが持ってきたのかな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wonder if someone brought it from somewhere else...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>スクール水着が干してある…
#. もう…ずっとだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That school swimsuit is still hanging out to dry. I\n"
"feel like it's been there forever.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかして、すでに犠牲になった誰かの物…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe it belonged to someone who's already been\n"
"killed...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>うーん、ボクの好きな
#. “ドクトルポッパー”がないじゃないか！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Dr. Popper's my favorite, but they don't have\n"
"it here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

